{"title": "Silver Necklace Jewelry Subtable", "pageid": 44922, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Silver_Necklace_Jewelry_Subtable", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Subtables", "Valuables tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Silver Necklace Jewelry Subtable</b>, also known as <code>ST_GEN_Valuables_Necklace_Silver</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_GEN_Valuables_Necklace_Silver+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_GEN_Valuables_Necklace_Silver+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing silver necklaces.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p>This table only drops one bronze necklace, due to <b>ARM_Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A</b> being non existent and the C/D/F versions having 0 shares.\n</p><p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{#lst:Silver Necklace Jewelry Subtable|table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Necklace\" title=\"Silver Necklace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_Unfade